---
// Section 3: How it works (three steps)
// Spec U4: "three steps: we build it in up to 3 days; every call is answered, booked and texted; we review and fix"
---

<section id="how-it-works" class="py-16 lg:py-24 bg-white border-b border-sky-blue/50">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-ink-deep tracking-tight font-heading">
        Ready in up to 3 days
      </h2>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Clean Minimal Step Cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-paper border border-sky-blue shadow-2xs flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg text-ink-deep mb-2">1. We set it up</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate leading-relaxed">
            We add your services, hours, prices and rules, then connect your calendar.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-paper border border-sky-blue shadow-2xs flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg text-ink-deep mb-2">2. It answers and books</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate leading-relaxed">
            It answers day and night, books visits and texts you the details.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-paper border border-sky-blue shadow-2xs flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg text-ink-deep mb-2">3. We check and improve it</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate leading-relaxed">
            We review calls and fix problems as they come up.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
